{"name":"Dropdown","description":"Open a compact menu of actions or destinations · A dropdown keeps secondary choices behind a trigger when showing them all would add clutter. Name the trigger clearly and keep the menu short and grouped. A frequent or important action should usually remain visible instead of being hidden.","quote":"When someone hovers over their username, show a dropdown with Settings and Sign out.","agentPrompt":"Put Rename, Duplicate, and Archive for each project row in a Dropdown with text labels; keep confirmation before Archive. Open and run reversible actions one by one, confirming the menu targets its current row and is fully keyboard-operable.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-dropdown\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Dropdown</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">When someone hovers over their username, show a dropdown with Settings and Sign out.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Open a compact menu of actions or destinations</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A dropdown keeps secondary choices behind a trigger when showing them all would add clutter. Name the trigger clearly and keep the menu short and grouped. A frequent or important action should usually remain visible instead of being hidden.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"dd-live\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"dd-open\">\n    <label class=\"dd-mask\" for=\"dd-open\"></label>\n    <div class=\"dd-wrap\">\n      <label class=\"btn btn-outline dd-btn\" for=\"dd-open\">More operations <span class=\"dd-caret\">▾</span></label>\n      <div class=\"dd-anim\">\n        <div class=\"dropdown-panel dd-panel\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s1\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item dd-item\" for=\"dd-s1\">Rename</label>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s2\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item dd-item\" for=\"dd-s2\">Copy link</label>\n          <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s3\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item danger dd-item\" for=\"dd-s3\">Delete</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">You can say this to an AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>Put Rename, Duplicate, and Archive for each project row in a Dropdown with text labels; keep confirmation before Archive. Open and run reversible actions one by one, confirming the menu targets its current row and is fully keyboard-operable.</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\"></div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>Dropdown</span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=en\" data-ref=\"select\">Select</a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/dropdown?lang=en\" data-ref=\"dropdown\" aria-label=\"Dropdown\">Dropdown</a> opens actions or navigation. <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=en\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"Select\">Select</a> chooses and saves a form value.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>When to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Secondary row actions</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">More actions <i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">Rename</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Copy link</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Move to…</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Delete</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Account menu</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex:none\">L</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">Profile</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Account settings</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Sign out</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Sort options</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">Save</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">More ▾</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">A compact set of related commands</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt on\">Save ⌘S</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Save As ⇧⌘S</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Export ⌘E</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Hide the main action in a More menu</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">Select a city ▾</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">Beijing</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Shanghai</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">Shenzhen</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Put a long, searchable dataset in an action menu</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">More ▾</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">Delete</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Open the menu from an unlabeled mystery icon</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">Preview</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">More ▾</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">A key publishing action hidden under “More” is hard to find</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Mix dangerous actions with common choices without separation</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">New</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">Move to ▸</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Delete</span></div><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">Project A</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">Project B</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"dropdown-demo\">\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">More actions ▾</button></div>\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-panel\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Rename</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\">Copy link</span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sep\"><span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">Delete</span>\n      </span></div>\n    </div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">Trigger</span></button><span class=\"pd\">A button or text control that opens the menu</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"panel\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">Panel</span></button><span class=\"pd\">A floating menu that closes when someone clicks outside it</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"item\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">MenuItem</span></button><span class=\"pd\">An action can have icons and shortcut keys</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"sep\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">Divider</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Group related menu items; separate destructive actions</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Basic</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Rename</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Copy link</span><span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">Delete</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">When related actions need to share one entry point</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Shortcut</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Save<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Export<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">When common actions have keyboard shortcuts</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Grouped</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-group\">View</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Compact Mode</span><span class=\"dropdown-group\">Operation</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Export</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">The menu contains multiple types of operations and needs to be grouped by category</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">Typical use cases</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">More actions</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <b style=\"font-size:13px\">Project files</b>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;margin-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1\">📄 Homepage-refresh.fig</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 hours ago</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;border-color:var(--brand);color:var(--brand)\">···</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1\">📄 Design-guidelines.md</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Yesterday</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">···</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:56px;width:132px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Rename</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Copy link</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Delete</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Account menu</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:158px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Workbench</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;font-size:12px\">🔔</span>\n        <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand-light)\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:14px;top:44px;width:158px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 12px 5px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px\">Alex Chen</b> <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">fox@museon.app</span></div>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Personal homepage</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">Account settings</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Log out</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Sort menu</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1\">Unnamed document.md</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700\">B</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;font-style:italic\">I</span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px\">File ▾</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:68%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:86%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:12px;top:38px;width:172px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save as <span class=\"dropdown-key\">⇧⌘S</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Export PDF<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Export options</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Weekly Report · Issue 29</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"font-size:12px;border-color:var(--brand);color:var(--brand)\">More ▾</button>\n      </div>\n      <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%;margin-top:7px\"></i>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:48px;width:136px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Export to PDF</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">Print</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Historical version</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"selector-recommendation\" aria-label=\"Recommended tool\"><div class=\"section-title\">Recommended tool</div><a class=\"selector-recommendation-card\" href=\"https://selector-pro.org/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open the Selector Pro website to pick a page element and copy a fine-tuning request to AI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"selector-recommendation-copy\"><span class=\"selector-recommendation-label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro</span><h2>Select page elements for precise AI edits</h2><p>Click a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.</p><span class=\"selector-recommendation-action\">Open Selector Pro website<i aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</i></span></div><div class=\"selector-recommendation-demo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"selector-mini-browser-bar\"><i></i><span>your-site.com</span></div><div class=\"selector-mini-page\"><span class=\"selector-mini-logo\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-nav\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-title\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-line\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-button\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-card\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-target\"><b>Button · Get started</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"selector-mini-note\">Use a smaller radius</span><svg class=\"selector-mini-cursor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 22\"><path d=\"M2 1.5v15.2l4.15-3.72 2.4 6.02 2.65-1.1-2.42-5.82h5.82L2 1.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"selector-mini-output\"><span>Button · Get started</span><b>Copied for AI</b></div></div></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Further reading</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/menu-button/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Menu Button Pattern</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/en/dropdown","markdown":"# Dropdown\n\nYou might say\nWhen someone hovers over their username, show a dropdown with Settings and Sign out.\n\n**Open a compact menu of actions or destinations**·A dropdown keeps secondary choices behind a trigger when showing them all would add clutter. Name the trigger clearly and keep the menu short and grouped. A frequent or important action should usually remain visible instead of being hidden.\n\n## You can say this to an AI Agent\n\n> “\n> Put Rename, Duplicate, and Archive for each project row in a Dropdown with text labels; keep confirmation before Archive. Open and run reversible actions one by one, confirming the menu targets its current row and is fully keyboard-operable.\n\nDropdown**≠**[Select](/vibe-hub/select?lang=en)\n\n[Dropdown](/vibe-hub/dropdown?lang=en) opens actions or navigation. [Select](/vibe-hub/select?lang=en) chooses and saves a form value.\n\n### When to use it\n\n- Secondary row actions\n\nMore actions \nRenameCopy linkMove to…Delete\n- Account menu\n\nL\nProfileAccount settingsSign out\n- Sort options\n\nSaveMore ▾\n- A compact set of related commands\n\nSave ⌘SSave As ⇧⌘SExport ⌘E\n\n### When NOT to use it\n\n- Hide the main action in a More menu\n\nSelect a city ▾\nBeijingShanghaiShenzhen\n- Put a long, searchable dataset in an action menu\n\nMore ▾\nDelete\n- Open the menu from an unlabeled mystery icon\n\nPreviewMore ▾\nA key publishing action hidden under “More” is hard to find\n- Mix dangerous actions with common choices without separation\n\nNewMove to ▸Delete\n\nProject AProject B\n\nAnatomy\n\nMore actions ▾\n\n      \nRename\n        Copy link\n        \n        Delete\n\n1TriggerA button or text control that opens the menu\n\n2PanelA floating menu that closes when someone clicks outside it\n\n3MenuItemAn action can have icons and shortcut keys\n\n4DividerGroup related menu items; separate destructive actions\n\nVariants\n\nBasic\n\nRenameCopy linkDelete\n\nWhen related actions need to share one entry point\n\nShortcut\n\nSave⌘SExport⌘E\n\nWhen common actions have keyboard shortcuts\n\nGrouped\n\nViewCompact ModeOperationExport\n\nThe menu contains multiple types of operations and needs to be grouped by category\n\nTypical use cases\n\nMore actions\n\n**Project files**\n      \n📄 Homepage-refresh.fig2 hours ago\n        ···\n\n      \n📄 Design-guidelines.mdYesterday\n        ···\n\n      \nRename\n        Copy link\n        \n        Delete\n\nAccount menu\n\n**Workbench**\n        🔔\n\n      \n**Alex Chen** fox@museon.app\n\n        \n        Personal homepage\n        Account settings\n        Log out\n\nSort menu\n\n**Unnamed document.md**\n        B\n        I\n        File ▾\n\n      \n\n      \nSave⌘S\n        Save as ⇧⌘S\n        Export PDF⌘E\n\nExport options\n\n**Weekly Report · Issue 29**\n        Save\n        More ▾\n\n      \n      \n      \nExport to PDF\n        Print\n        Historical version\n\nRecommended tool\n[Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro\n\n## Select page elements for precise AI edits\n\nClick a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.\nOpen Selector Pro website↗\n\nyour-site.com\n\n**Button · Get started**Use a smaller radius\n\nButton · Get started**Copied for AI**](https://selector-pro.org/)\n\nFurther reading\n\n[Menu Button PatternWAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/menu-button/)"}